256:Recall the definition from \citep{RS}. For consistency, we duplicate their notation exactly. For polynomial system $\mathcal{F}$, and subset of variables $Y$, let $\mathcal{F}_Y$ denote the subset of polynomials from $\mathcal{F}$ which contain at least one variable from $Y$.
