One oracle has solved `easy`, so that rung will not ship. The harness is continuing the remaining independent attempts before moving to `medium`; I’ll inspect the returned witness afterward for any renderer/parser issue, but this first result appears to be a genuine solve.
diff --git a/gen_1605_04472.py b/gen_1605_04472.py
