   587	if $y_i$ is 1 in this vector, assign the corresponding literal $l_i$ to be True, if $y_i$ is 0 in this vector, assign the corresponding literal $l_i$ to be False. Since $y\in \{0,1\}^{|Y\backslash Y'|}$, this routine makes an assignment for every $l_i$ corresponding to a  $y_i \in Y\backslash Y'$. 
