-    generated set is f_j=u_j*S+d_j*b_j. Its coefficient matrix is
-    diag(d)+u*1^T, whose determinant is prod(d_j)*(1+sum(u_j/d_j)) and is
-    therefore nonzero because u_j,d_j are positive. Thus <F>=<B> without
